      "writtenOn": "2026-02-26T18:26:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The fix for subsetting to use a list of all known table tags landed in HarfBuzz 4.4.0. If one can depend on that it might be fine to make this change and only use `hb_face_set_get_table_tags_func` when compiling with HarfBuzz 10 or later headers. However, it appears there was one distro that still \"supports\" HarfBuzz 3.2 on which this code will always produce an empty hb_font.\n\nFor the time being it will be necessary to have an old and new code path, selected based on the HarfBuzz header version at compile time.",
